    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rare opportunity to buy a detached, 5 bedroom family home in a prime residential location close to some of South Dublin's finest schools, including the French School, Hollypark Boys and Girls National Schools and Loreto Foxrock to name a few.\r\n\r\nThe house features 5 bedrooms, three double bedrooms and two single bedrooms, main bathroom, guest w.c, large family living room, interconnecting into the dining room, connecting to the dining/ kitchen and sunroom off. There is also a smaller living room downstairs, off street parking to the front and north west facing private rear garden with side access.\r\n\r\nThe house is in need of refurbishment, offering the purchaser an opportunity to put their own stamp on the house. It is also ideally located at the end of the estate with just one other detached, family home beside it.\r\n\r\n38 Foxrock Green is only a couple of minutes walk to the main bus routes into and out of town serviced via the N11, and the M50 at Carrickmines is less then a ten minute drive away servicing greater Dublin and the main motorways.\r\n\r\nFor more information and to arrange a viewing please contact Alan Ferris on 0868114286."
      },
      {
